# No environment variables or external services are required.
# Node.js 24 includes SQLite. Local requests create .data/nattitor.sqlite if absent.
# On Vercel (VERCEL=1), the read-only demo uses the system temporary directory.
# Temporary demo copies can disappear and are recreated from the sample dataset.
# Existing database files are never reset or automatically migrated.
# Legacy remote database variables are ignored by the application.
